give it up, y'all!

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:04.910
(audience applauds)

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:07.800
All right, it's another
Rad Mama Hour again,

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.730
there are a few things that are guaranteed

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:11.240
